      "content": "thanks. okay so here is what i noticed today. around 2:14 pm the pendulum has this really long drag, like it's struggling to push through something, and then at exactly 4:42 pm there is this sharp, double tap sound instead of a smooth swing. it's super specific. i was thinking back to historical stuff and 1906 or maybe some major shifts in the early 20th century... do those specific times or intervals mean anything to you in a historical context? like is there any kind of connection there?",
